  "title": "Clarification on Recent Private Sale of Series C Preferred Stock",
  "summary": "By Andy Marsh, President & CEO There seems to be confusion about a transaction that occurred earlier this week. An affiliate of one of our board members purchased approximately half of Air Liquide’s remaining stake in the Series C Preferred stock. This was done at the market price of about $1.18 per common share equivalent […]",
